      <description>&lt;p&gt;we&amp;rsquo;re an indie duo based in switzerland.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;we started making music in 2021, after tobias made a post on a local music website looking to start a band, and ana replied.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;we produce our music ourselves, with tobias taking the guitar and backing vocal duties and ana doing the singing, playing the keys and the electric cello.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;if you want to say hi, we would love to hear from you.&#xA;you can contact us on social media or via email: &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:hi@bitesizedband.com&#34;&gt;hi@bitesizedband.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
